    {
      "id": "extract-page-text",
      "name": "Extract Page Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        704,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const html = $json.data || $json.body || '';\nconst text = String(html)\n  .replace(/<script[\\s\\S]*?<\\/script>/gi, ' ')\n  .replace(/<style[\\s\\S]*?<\\/style>/gi, ' ')\n  .replace(/<noscript[\\s\\S]*?<\\/noscript>/gi, ' ')\n  .replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ')\n  .replace(/&nbsp;/gi, ' ')\n  .replace(/&amp;/gi, '&')\n  .replace(/&lt;/gi, '<')\n  .replace(/&gt;/gi, '>')\n  .replace(/&quot;/gi, '\"')\n  .replace(/&#\\d+;/g, ' ')\n  .replace(/\\s+/g, ' ')\n  .trim();\nreturn [{ json: Object.assign({}, $('Normalize Request').first().json, { page_text: text.slice(0, 12000) }) }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-cro-audit-agent",
      "name": "AI CRO Audit Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        928,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ 'Audit this landing page. URL: ' + $json.page_url + '\\n\\nPAGE CONTENT:\\n' + $json.page_text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a world-class conversion rate optimization expert who audits landing pages for founders and marketers. You are blunt but constructive: you roast weak pages candidly, then deliver fixes that are specific to THIS page, never generic advice.\n\nAudit the landing page content you are given and return ONLY valid JSON (no markdown, no code fences) with exactly these keys:\n{\n  \"overall_score\": number 0-100, conversion readiness of the page,\n  \"sub_scores\": {\"clarity_of_offer\": 0-100, \"headline_strength\": 0-100, \"social_proof\": 0-100, \"cta_effectiveness\": 0-100, \"objection_handling\": 0-100, \"urgency_or_scarcity\": 0-100},\n  \"roast_summary\": string, 80-140 words. A candid, human, slightly funny roast of what is broken on THIS page. Reference actual copy from the page. No markdown,\n  \"recommendations\": array of exactly 10 objects, each {\"priority\": \"P1\" to \"P10\", \"title\": string, \"why\": string referencing something specific on this page, \"fix\": string, exact copy or change to make, self-explanatory, \"effort\": \"low\" or \"medium\" or \"high\", \"impact\": \"low\" or \"medium\" or \"high\"}\n}\n\nRules: every recommendation must be personalised to this page and reference the roast. Rank P1 first (highest impact, lowest effort first). Write fixes as ready-to-use copy or precise instructions, never vague advice like \"improve the headline\"."
        },
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.1
    },
