    {
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -848,
        -624
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## 08-29-01 audit landing pages with AI conversion score roast and fix list\n\n### How it works\n- Submit a landing page URL and your email on the form\n- The page is fetched, stripped to clean text and analyzed by an AI conversion expert\n- The AI returns an overall score, 6 dimension sub-scores, a candid roast and 10 prioritized fixes\n- Every audit is logged to Google Sheets and emailed as a full report\n- Pages scoring under 75 also fire a Telegram alert to the team\n- Every Monday 9am a weekly digest summarizes the last 7 days of audits\n\n### Setup steps\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and point the two Sheets nodes at your audit log spreadsheet\n- Connect Gmail credentials for the report, notice and digest emails\n- Connect the OpenAI chat model credential for both AI agents\n- Add Telegram credentials for the low-score alert (optional)\n\n### Customization\n- Adjust the alert threshold on the If Score Alert node\n- Tune the audit prompt and JSON keys in the AI CRO Audit Agent\n- Change the digest schedule on the Weekly Digest Trigger node"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
